 "schema": 1,
 "about": "Ratchet & Clank inspired gadget-panel look, original drawing and colours: deep navy space, a purple main accent, cyan for interaction and selection, gold for release highlights only, Qwark green for identity only; bevelled and bolted panels, a holo grid and a ring/orbit dial. Not an official brand specification and not sampled from any game, logo or screenshot. Shared launcher, site, badge and installer-art tokens plus curated per-game accents; no artwork pixels or remote requests are required for themes.",
 "accent_bg": "#5b3fb5",
 "deviations": [
  "Series-inspired navy, purple, cyan and gold replace the earlier navy/orange/steel look (which replaced the GNOME (libadwaita) look).",
  "The website keeps a few more tokens than the launcher (the \"site\" block: purple, gold and green roles, grid and glow lines, a cyan interaction accent); its surfaces equal the launcher's.",
  "Original title-specific accents complement covers; they are authored design choices, not official or automatically sampled colors.",
  "Opaque text surfaces, OKLab text derivation and WCAG 4.5:1 checks remain."
 ],
